            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> of clustered ASAs (i.e., ASAs that have live LB setups).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>One would read the chart on the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true' underline='true'>left-hand side</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> as follows: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Loved Brands</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> in </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true' underline='true'>ASAs that are NOT on live setups</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> in PH form </run>
