            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>of vendors in the parent-child combination (i.e., within the cluster) on average, whereas the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Non-Loved Brands</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> in</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true' underline='true'>ASAs that are NOT on live setups</run>
