    <worksheet name='Penetration Rate Stats - Order/Vendor Share of Entity'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run><![CDATA[<Sheet Name> of Clustered and Non-Clustered ASAs
]]></run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>N.B. </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>The left graph shows the order and vendor share of ASAs with live LB setups (clustered ASAs) vs. ASAs that do not have live LB setups (non-clustered ASAs).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>One would read the graph as follows: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>The ASAs with live LB setups in PH form </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.1vh7fur07nvcv215aacfw1g99dxu].[sum:Calculation_745627228638306304:qk]> ]]></run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>of all </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>orders</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.1vh7fur07nvcv215aacfw1g99dxu].[sum:Clustered Asas Order Share of Entity_PK (copy)_745627228638773249:qk]>]]></run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> of all </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>vendors</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> in the country. The ASAs that do </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>NOT </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>have live LB setups in PK form </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.1vh7fur07nvcv215aacfw1g99dxu].[sum:Clustered Asas Order Share of Entity_PK (copy)_745627228638892034:qk]> ]]></run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>of all </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>orders</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.1vh7fur07nvcv215aacfw1g99dxu].[sum:Clustered Asas Vendor Share of Entity_PK (copy)_745627228638892035:qk]>]]></run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> of all </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>vendors</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ff0000' fontsize='8' italic='true'> in the country.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
